a-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">Stone</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$75/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$108/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$126/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v.1.52.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Flameslate</b> can be discovered deep within the depths of the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a>, nestled upon small islands surrounded by <b>molten lava</b>.\n</p><p>As of the 1.67.0 update, <b>Flameslate</b> can spawn <a href=\"/wiki/Magmite\" title=\"Magmite\">Magmite</a> in their rocks.\n</p><p><b>Note:</b> Exercise caution when attempting to get <b>Flameslate</b>, as the intense heat will scorch you as you travel the bridges and planks connecting the islands. Always ensure you have a <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing Coil</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> ready to mitigate the effects of the heat.\n</p><p>The respawn time of Flameslate is unknown, although it does respawn in some servers, it is found that it frequently respawns every 5-10 minutes. Its recommended to farm Flameslate on solo Servers because leaving and rejoining will respawn the ores but you will have to blow up the rocks again.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 251px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Flameslate_Location-Appearance.png/revision/latest?cb=20240617174814\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flameslate Location-Appearance\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"251\" height=\"203\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flameslate Location-Appearance.png\" data-image-key=\"Flameslate_Location-Appearance.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Flameslate_Location-Appearance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/251?cb=20240617174814\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Flameslate_Location-Appearance.png/revision/latest?cb=20240617174814\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flameslate Location-Appearance\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Flameslate_Location-Appearance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/251?cb=20240617174814\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"251\" height=\"203\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Flameslate Location-Appearance.png\" data-image-key=\"Flameslate_Location-Appearance.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Flameslate_Location-Appearance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/251?cb=20240617174814\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Flameslate_Location-Appearance.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Flameslate</b> shares the same stone, refined and forged textures as <a href=\"/wiki/Fungoidite\" title=\"Fungoidite\">Fungoidite</a>, but with a distinctive twist. Its textures emulate molten lava, and the raw stone appears to be ablaze.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"ba1e78827fa98b9ac8e4673bace18f4f\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:102px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Flameslatetexture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:94px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Flameslatetexture.png\" title=\"Flameslatetexture.png (88 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:94px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/88/Flameslatetexture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/94?cb=20240326133937\" title=\"Flameslatetexture.png (88 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Raw\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Flameslatetexture.png\" data-image-key=\"Flameslatetexture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Raw\"></noscript><img styl